<title>FRANCE: France sells 775 mln Ecu OATs at auction.</title>
<headline>France sells 775 mln Ecu OATs at auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury sold the following government bonds (OATs) at auction on Thursday.</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 25.APR.07	5.50	   775 MLN	   6.34</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 1.750 MLN/2.3		    NIL		93.76</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 60.0						    23.JAN</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT AUCTION</p>
<p>							    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - The Treasury originally announced it would sell 600 to 800 million francs of Ecu-denominated OATs in total today.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
